{
  "_about": [
    "The scene registry: one entry per scene type, read by the bundle (the camera's class and kicks, Promo's SELF_STARTING) and by the Node tools (visual.mjs STAGINGS, tools/ci/screentext.mjs, the fx planner). Add an entry with every new scene file.",
    "cls: picture | data | text | end (the text rules' classes; end = EndCard, outside every share). clsIf: [{when, cls}] changes it by the spec's props: when {prop: value} matches a prop's value, {prop: '*'} any set value; maxWords: the scene's words must be at most that too.",
    "cam: band | free | self (src/lib/camera.tsx sceneClass: band moves inside the picture's clip, free moves the whole scene at most 1.2 %, self keeps the old 1 % drift).",
    "selfStart: the scene starts its own run after the cut when the spec gives no `at` (Promo's subtitle haptic leaves it alone).",
    "stagings: the first is the default. text: the props that draw words: path is dotted, [] maps over an array, a string element or an object's `text` is the text, * is any string prop not in `except`; max = words per item; dup false = an identity label (a caller's name, a chat contact, a notification title) that may repeat the subtitle. words: the most words the whole scene may draw (null: its own rule).",
    "dur: [min, ideal, max] seconds. moves: the camera moves the planner may pick (none: the legacy drift). kicks: dotted paths of `at` values that fire a camera kick.",
    "lookPath (Film): the prop that sets its class: look 'diagram' is data, 'illustrated' is picture.",
    "BigNumber, Callback, KineticHeadline, PhotoStory, Split, Timeline and Twist are the first batch's scenes (2026-10-06)."
  ],
  "Title": {
    "cls": "text",
    "clsIf": [{"when": {"bg": "*"}, "cls": "picture", "maxWords": 3}, {"when": {"backdrop": "*"}, "cls": "picture", "maxWords": 3}],
    "cam": "free",
    "selfStart": false,
    "stagings": [],
    "text": [{"path": "lines[]", "max": 3}, {"path": "kicker", "max": 3}],
    "words": 5,
    "dur": [0.8, 2, 4],
    "moves": ["push", "drift-l", "drift-r", "still"],
    "kicks": ["lines[].at"]
  },
